# Line-ending policy
#
# The repository stores LF for every text file, on every platform. Contributors
# on Windows must not see whole files rewritten just because their checkout uses
# CRLF, and contributors on Linux/macOS must not be handed CRLF.
#
# Why this file exists: with core.autocrlf=true and no attributes, a fresh clone
# on Windows checked out 355 of the tracked files with CRLF in the working tree
# while the index held LF. `git status` then reported files as modified with an
# empty diff - a phantom change that hides real edits in review and makes
# "did I change anything?" unanswerable.
#
# The rules below set that to zero. Measured on a throwaway clone of this repo:
# worktree CRLF files went 355 -> 0, `git add --renormalize .` produced no diff
# at all (nothing in history needed rewriting), and all 6 binary files stayed
# untouched.
#
# Verify after changing this file:
#   git ls-files --eol | grep -c 'w/crlf'   # expect 0
#   git add --renormalize . && git diff --cached --stat   # expect empty
#
# A fresh checkout may still be needed once, because files already on disk are
# not rewritten by the attributes alone:
#   git rm -r --cached . && git reset --hard

# Detect text vs binary from content, so an image is never line-ending
# translated even if it is misnamed.
* text=auto

# Store LF, and check out LF. This second line is what actually does the work.
# Measured: with `text=auto` alone and core.autocrlf=true, a fresh clone still
# checked out 356 CRLF files - `text=auto` picks the line ending by sniffing
# content, and does not override core.autocrlf for checkout. `eol=lf` states the
# working-copy ending explicitly and does override it. Keep both lines: `auto`
# supplies the text/binary decision, `eol=lf` supplies the line ending.
* text eol=lf

# Binaries: never translate. Listed explicitly so a new image type added later
# is covered by the same decision rather than relying on content sniffing.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.svg  text
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf  binary